# Implementation Plan - Epic-like EHR System Modules

We will implement the requested Epic-like features in a modular, phased manner. Because the scope is extremely large (encompassing full EHR, Billing/Revenue Cycle, MyChart Patient Portal, Specialty Modules, Operations, CRM, and AI), we propose a structured roadmap and ask for your prioritization on the initial focus area.

